# Learn more at:
# http://docs.owid.io/projects/etl/architecture/metadata/reference/
meta:
  origin:
    # Data product / Snapshot
    title: Births and fertility rates from national statistics
    description: |-
      Our World in Data compiled the yearly number of births and the total fertility rate for 2010–2025 from each country's national statistics office, civil registry, or health ministry. The figures are used as published, and the most recent published figure is used for each year.

      A country or area is included when all of the following are true:

      1. It is a country or area in the UN's World Population Prospects, and had at least 1 million people in 2023, according to those estimates.
      2. Its yearly count of births is at least 90% complete. We go by what the country reports, to the UN or in a household survey since 2010, unless a census or survey shows the count is less complete than that.
      3. A national government body publishes this yearly count, such as the civil registry, the statistics office, or the health ministry. Model estimates and survey results don't count.
      4. The count is available for at least one year from 2020 onward.
      5. The count covers the same population the UN covers. If the national figures leave out or add areas or groups making up 3% or more of births, the country is left out. Below that, it is included with a note.

      The spreadsheet has four tabs: an introduction, the data (with the sources and notes for each year), the sources, and every country or area in the UN's World Population Prospects 2024, with whether it is included and why not.
    date_published: "2026-11-27"

    # Citation
    producer: Official data collated by Our World in Data
    # NOTE: The snapshot script builds citation_full from the spreadsheet's Data and Sources tabs. Don't edit it by hand.
    citation_full: |-
      Our World in Data (2026). Births and fertility rates from national statistics. Compiled from the published figures of national statistics offices, civil registries, and health ministries: [spreadsheet with the data, sources, and notes for each year, and the reason each country is left out](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1fifzj8l5Y55Jp5Xrr4FNipeEzl6GenbasjS6FpCvJ68/edit).

      Sources for each country, with the years each one covers, and notes on the data:

      - Albania: [INSTAT, Database table BD0008: Live births, deaths and natural increase](https://databaza.instat.gov.al:8083/pxweb/en/DST/START__BD__BIRTH/BD0008/) (2010–2025); [INSTAT, Database table Indeksi01: Total fertility rate](https://databaza.instat.gov.al:8083/pxweb/en/DST/START__BD__DI/Indeksi01/) (2010–2025). Notes: 2010–2011: Fertility rate uses population estimates from before the 2023 census, unlike later years.
      - Algeria: [ONS Algérie, Rétrospective statistique 1962–2020, chapitre I: Démographie (tableau 1)](https://www.ons.dz/IMG/pdf/CH1_Demographie1962_2020Fr.pdf) (2010–2019); [ONS Algérie, Démographie algérienne 2019, N°890 bis (tableau 2)](https://www.ons.dz/IMG/pdf/Demographie2019bis.pdf) (2010–2019); [ONS Algérie, Démographie algérienne 2020 à 2023, N°1030 (tableau 12)](https://www.ons.dz/IMG/pdf/Demographie_Alg2020_2023.pdf) (2020–2023). Notes: 2010–2019: Births are by year of registration. The fertility rate is an ONS estimate. 2020–2023: Births are by year of registration.
      - Argentina: [DEIS, Ministerio de Salud, Estadísticas vitales: información básica, año 2010 (tabla 1)](https://www.argentina.gob.ar/sites/default/files/serie5nro54.pdf) (2010); [DEIS, Ministerio de Salud, Estadísticas vitales: información básica, año 2011 (tabla 1)](https://www.argentina.gob.ar/sites/default/files/serie5nro55.pdf) (2011); [DEIS, Ministerio de Salud, Estadísticas vitales: información básica, año 2012 (tabla 1)](https://www.argentina.gob.ar/sites/default/files/serie5nro56.pdf) (2012); [DEIS, Ministerio de Salud, Estadísticas vitales: información básica, año 2013 (tabla 1)](https://www.argentina.gob.ar/sites/default/files/serie5nro57.pdf) (2013); [DEIS, Ministerio de Salud, Estadísticas vitales: información básica, año 2014 (tabla 1)](https://www.argentina.gob.ar/sites/default/files/serie5nro58.pdf) (2014); [DEIS, Ministerio de Salud, Estadísticas vitales: información básica, año 2015 (tabla 1)](https://www.argentina.gob.ar/sites/default/files/serie5numero59.pdf) (2015); [DEIS, Ministerio de Salud, Estadísticas vitales: información básica, año 2016 (tabla 1)](https://www.argentina.gob.ar/sites/default/files/serie5nro60.pdf) (2016); [DEIS, Ministerio de Salud, Estadísticas vitales: información básica, año 2017 (tabla 1)](https://www.argentina.gob.ar/sites/default/files/serie5nro61.pdf) (2017); [DEIS, Ministerio de Salud, Estadísticas vitales: información básica, año 2018 (tabla 1)](https://www.argentina.gob.ar/sites/default/files/serie5nro62.pdf) (2018); [DEIS, Ministerio de Salud, Estadísticas vitales: información básica, año 2019 (tabla 1)](https://www.argentina.gob.ar/sites/default/files/serie5numero63.pdf) (2019); [DEIS, Ministerio de Salud, Estadísticas vitales: información básica, año 2020 (tabla 1)](https://www.argentina.gob.ar/sites/default/files/serie5numero64_web.pdf) (2020); [Dirección Nacional de Población, Ministerio del Interior, La natalidad y la fecundidad en Argentina entre 1980 y 2020 (section 3.1.4)](https://www.argentina.gob.ar/sites/default/files/2023/10/la_natalidad_y_la_fecundidad_en_argentina_entre_1980_y_2020_0.pdf) (2020); [DEIS, Ministerio de Salud, Estadísticas vitales: información básica, año 2021 (tabla 1)](https://www.argentina.gob.ar/sites/default/files/serie_5_nro_65_anuario_vitales_2021_-_web.pdf) (2021); [Dirección Nacional de Población, Ministerio del Interior, Análisis de tendencias de nacimientos en Argentina 2012–2021 (introduction)](https://www.argentina.gob.ar/sites/default/files/2023/10/informe_natalidad_2023.pdf) (2021); [DEIS, Ministerio de Salud, Estadísticas vitales: información básica, año 2022 (tabla 1)](https://www.argentina.gob.ar/sites/default/files/serie_5_nro_66_anuario_vitales_2022_3.pdf) (2022); [INDEC, Estimaciones y proyecciones de población 2022–2040, total del país (Análisis demográfico 39, sección 5.1)](https://www.indec.gob.ar/ftp/cuadros/publicaciones/proyecciones_nacionales_2022_2040.pdf) (2022); [DEIS, Ministerio de Salud, Estadísticas vitales: información básica, año 2023 (tabla 1)](https://www.argentina.gob.ar/sites/default/files/serie_5_nro_67_anuario_vitales_2023-version_final.pdf) (2023); [DEIS, Ministerio de Salud, Estadísticas vitales: información básica, año 2024 (tabla 1)](https://www.argentina.gob.ar/sites/default/files/serie_5_nro_68_anuario_vitales_2024_v2.pdf) (2024). Notes: 2010–2019, 2023–2024: Births are by year of registration. 2020–2021: Births are by year of registration. Fertility rate uses population estimates from before the 2022 census, unlike 2022. 2022: Births are by year of registration. The fertility rate is an INDEC estimate.
      - Armenia: [Armstat, Demographic Handbook of Armenia 2025 (tables 1.4 and 3.10)](https://armstat.am/en/?nid=82&id=2786) (2010–2024); [Armstat, Demographic Handbook of Armenia 2021 (table 3.10)](https://armstat.am/en/?nid=82&id=2446) (2010); [Armstat, Demographic Handbook of Armenia 2022 (table 3.10)](https://armstat.am/en/?nid=82&id=2535) (2011); [Armstat, Demographic Handbook of Armenia 2023 (table 3.10)](https://armstat.am/en/?nid=82&id=2624) (2012); [Armstat, Demographic Handbook of Armenia 2024 (table 3.10)](https://armstat.am/en/?nid=82&id=2705) (2013–2022); [Armstat, Indicators of RA population natural movement, 2022–2025 (sheet Births)](https://armstat.am/file/doc/99568918.xls) (2025). Notes: 2010–2022: Fertility rate uses population estimates from before the 2022 census, unlike later years.
      - Australia: [ABS, National, state and territory population: births and total fertility rates (March-quarter data cubes, 2016–2026)](https://www.abs.gov.au/statistics/people/population/national-state-and-territory-population) (2010–2025); [ABS, Dataflow FERTILITY_AGE_STATE: Total fertility rate](https://data.api.abs.gov.au/rest/data/ABS,FERTILITY_AGE_STATE/all?startPeriod=2010) (2010–2025). Notes: 2010–2024: Births are ABS estimates by year of birth, including an allowance for births not yet registered. The fertility rate is by year of registration. 2025: Births are ABS estimates by year of birth, including an allowance for births not yet registered. The fertility rate is by year of registration. Number of births is provisional.
      - Austria: [Statistik Austria, Open data: Geborene (OGD_geborene_ext_GEB_1)](https://data.statistik.gv.at/data/OGD_geborene_ext_GEB_1.csv) (2010–2025); [Statistik Austria, Demographische Indikatoren, Zeitreihen 1961–2025, Österreich](https://www.statistik.at/fileadmin/pages/411/OEsterreich_Zeitreihenindikatoren_1961_2025.ods) (2010–2025).
      - Azerbaijan: [State Statistical Committee of the Republic of Azerbaijan, Table 2.1: Natural increase, births and deaths](https://www.stat.gov.az/source/demoqraphy/en/002_1en.xls) (2010–2025); [State Statistical Committee of the Republic of Azerbaijan, Table 2.3: Total fertility rate by urban and rural areas](https://www.stat.gov.az/source/demoqraphy/en/002_3en.xls) (2010–2025). Notes: 2010–2023: Births are by year of registration. Leaves out Nagorno-Karabakh (about 1–2% of births). 2024–2025: Births are by year of registration.
      - Bahrain: [Ministry of Health, Bahrain, Health Statistics 2014, vital statistics chapter (table 2)](https://www.moh.gov.bh/Content/Files/Publications/statistics/HS2014/PDF/Chapters/vital%20statistics_2014.pdf) (2010); [Ministry of Health, Bahrain, Total fertility rate (Bahrain Open Data Portal)](https://www.data.gov.bh/explore/dataset/06-total-fertility-rate/) (2010–2024); [Ministry of Health, Bahrain, Live births by nationality and sex (Bahrain Open Data Portal)](https://www.data.gov.bh/explore/dataset/01-live-births/) (2011–2024). Notes: 2015–2024: Births include babies born abroad to Bahraini citizens.
      - Belarus: [Belstat, Dissemination database, indicator 10101200001: Number of births](https://dataportal.belstat.gov.by/osids/indicator-info/10101200001) (2010–2019, 2024–2025); [Belstat, Dissemination database, indicator 10101200011: Total fertility rate](https://dataportal.belstat.gov.by/osids/indicator-info/10101200011) (2010–2019, 2024–2025).
      - Belgium: [Statbel, Evolution of the number of births in Belgium 1830-2025](https://statbel.fgov.be/sites/default/files/files/documents/bevolking/5.5%20Geboorten%20en%20vruchtbaarheid/BirthEvo_1830-NL.xls) (2010–2025); [Statbel, Births and fertility workbooks, one per year (fertility indicators table)](https://statbel.fgov.be/en/themes/population/natality-and-fertility) (2010–2022); [Statbel, Births and fertility 2023, definitive results (tab 21)](https://statbel.fgov.be/en/themes/population/natality-and-fertility) (2023); [Statbel, Births and fertility 2024, provisional results (tab 21)](https://statbel.fgov.be/sites/default/files/files/documents/bevolking/5.5%20Geboorten%20en%20vruchtbaarheid/BE_Naissances%20et%20f%C3%A9condit%C3%A9_2024_PRVSR.xlsx) (2024); [Statbel, Births and fertility 2025, provisional results (tab 21)](https://statbel.fgov.be/en/themes/population/natality-and-fertility) (2025). Notes: 2015–2018, 2024–2025: Fertility rate is provisional.
      - Benin: [INStaD (Institut National de la Statistique et de la Démographie), Benin, Annuaire statistique 2024, tableau 03.11](https://instad.bj/images/docs/insae-publications/annuelles/AS-INSAE/Annee_2024/Annuaire%202024.pdf) (2011, 2013, 2017, 2021); [INSAE (now INStaD), Benin, MICS 2014, Résumé](https://www.instad.bj/images/docs/insae-statistiques/enquetes-recensements/Autres-Enquetes/Autres/RESUME%20DE%20L'ENQUETE%20MICS%202014%20AU%20BENIN.pdf) (2014); [INStaD (Institut National de la Statistique et de la Démographie), Benin, Annuaire des statistiques des faits d'état civil 2020 (national totals)](https://instad.bj/images/docs/insae-statistiques/Etat-civil/ANNUAIRE_DES_STAT_DE_L'ETAT_CIVIL_2020.pdf) (2020); [INStaD (Institut National de la Statistique et de la Démographie), Benin, Annuaire des statistiques des faits d'état civil 2022 (national totals)](https://instad.bj/images/docs/insae-statistiques/Etat-civil/ANNUAIRE_DES_STAT_DE_L'ETAT_CIVIL_2022.pdf) (2022); [INStaD (Institut National de la Statistique et de la Démographie), Benin, Annuaire des statistiques des faits d'état civil 2024 (national totals)](https://instad.bj/images/docs/insae-statistiques/Etat-civil/ANNUAIRE_DES_STAT_DE_L'ETAT_CIVIL_2024.pdf) (2023–2024). Notes: 2011, 2014, 2017, 2021: The fertility rate is from a household survey. 2013: The fertility rate is from the census. 2020, 2022–2024: Births are birth declarations to the national register of persons, mostly made at health facilities, not completed civil registrations.
      - Bolivia: [INE Bolivia (SERECI civil registry data), Número de partidas de nacimiento de menores de un año, por año de registro, 2010–2025](https://nube.ine.gob.bo/index.php/s/fps0vBJBd7R0c34/download) (2010–2025); [INE Bolivia, Cuadro 3.01.03.04: Tasa global de fecundidad (Encuesta de Demografía y Salud, EDSA)](https://nube.ine.gob.bo/index.php/s/tXaTJM8geaZhUSf/download) (2016, 2023); [INE Bolivia, Estimaciones y proyecciones de población, Revisión 2025, methodology report (annex 1)](https://nimbus.ine.gob.bo/index.php/s/PaHRM4KgJXASM6n/download) (2024). Notes: 2010–2015, 2017–2022: Births are registrations of babies under 1, by year of registration. 2016, 2023: Births are registrations of babies under 1, by year of registration. The fertility rate is from a household survey. 2024: Births are registrations of babies under 1, by year of registration. The fertility rate is an INE estimate. 2025: Births are registrations of babies under 1, by year of registration. Number of births is provisional.
      - Bosnia and Herzegovina: [Agency for Statistics of Bosnia and Herzegovina, Demography 2025, thematic bulletin (tables 9 and 16)](https://bhas.gov.ba/data/Publikacije/Bilteni/2026/DEM_00_2025_TB_1_BS.pdf) (2010–2025). Notes: 2010–2011: Fertility rate uses an older population base than later years.
      - Brazil: [Ministério da Saúde (SINASC), DATASUS TabNet: Nascidos vivos, Brasil](http://tabnet.datasus.gov.br/cgi/deftohtm.exe?sinasc/cnv/nvuf.def) (2010–2025); [IBGE, Anuário Estatístico do Brasil 2025, table 2.1.3.3 (Projeções da população, revisão 2024, TFT)](https://anuario.ibge.gov.br/images/aeb/2025/s2/2_pdf/s2t1303.pdf) (2010–2023). Notes: 2010–2023: Births are health ministry birth records, not civil registrations. The fertility rate is an IBGE estimate. 2024: Births are health ministry birth records, not civil registrations. 2025: Births are health ministry birth records, not civil registrations. Number of births is provisional.
      - Bulgaria: [National Statistical Institute, Bulgaria, Births by place of residence, statistical regions, districts and sex](https://www.nsi.bg/en/statistical-data/217/693) (2010–2025); [National Statistical Institute, Bulgaria, Total fertility rate by statistical regions, districts and place of residence](https://www.nsi.bg/en/statistical-data/215/687) (2010–2025). Notes: 2010–2021: Births include babies born abroad to people with an address in Bulgaria; late registrations count in the year registered. Fertility rate uses population estimates from before the 2021 census, unlike later years. 2022–2025: Births include babies born abroad to people with an address in Bulgaria; late registrations count in the year registered.
      - Canada: [Statistics Canada, Table 13-10-0416-01: Live births, by age of mother](https://www150.statcan.gc.ca/t1/tbl1/en/tv.action?pid=1310041601) (2010–2025); [Statistics Canada, Table 13-10-0418-01: Crude birth rate, age-specific fertility rates and total fertility rate](https://www150.statcan.gc.ca/t1/tbl1/en/tv.action?pid=1310041801) (2010–2025). Notes: 2025: Number of births is provisional.
      - Chile: [INE Chile, Series vitales 1992-2025(p) (sheets Nacimientos and Fecundidad)](https://www.ine.gob.cl/docs/default-source/nacimientos-matrimonios-y-defunciones/cuadros-estadisticos/series-hist%C3%B3ricas/series-vitales-1992-2025(p).xlsx) (2010–2025). Notes: 2024–2025: Births and fertility rate are provisional.
      - China: [National Bureau of Statistics (NBS), China, 2010 Population Census, long-form table 6-4 (total fertility rate)](https://www.stats.gov.cn/sj/pcsj/rkpc/6rp/html/B0604a.htm) (2010); [National Health Commission (NHC), China, China Health Statistics Yearbook 2025 (中国卫生健康统计年鉴), table 8-3-1 (live births)](https://www.nhc.gov.cn/mohwsbwstjxxzx/tjtjnj/202604/155ab0f98dfd4b12874f08f828df1452.shtml) (2016–2024); [National Bureau of Statistics (NBS), China, 2020 Population Census, long-form table 6-4 (total fertility rate)](https://www.stats.gov.cn/sj/pcsj/rkpc/7rp/zk/html/B0604.jpg) (2020). Notes: 2010: The fertility rate is from the census. 2016–2019, 2021–2024: Births are hospital delivery reports to the health ministry, not civil registrations. 2020: Births are hospital delivery reports to the health ministry, not civil registrations. The fertility rate is from the census.
      - Colombia: [DANE, Estadísticas vitales: nacimientos 2010, cifras definitivas](https://www.dane.gov.co/index.php/estadisticas-por-tema/salud/nacimientos-y-defunciones/nacimientos/nacimientos-2010) (2010); [DANE, Estadísticas vitales: nacimientos 2011, cifras definitivas](https://www.dane.gov.co/index.php/estadisticas-por-tema/salud/nacimientos-y-defunciones/nacimientos/nacimientos-2011) (2011); [DANE, Estadísticas vitales: nacimientos 2012, cifras definitivas](https://www.dane.gov.co/index.php/estadisticas-por-tema/salud/nacimientos-y-defunciones/nacimientos/nacimientos-2012) (2012); [DANE, Estadísticas vitales: nacimientos 2013, cifras definitivas](https://www.dane.gov.co/index.php/estadisticas-por-tema/salud/nacimientos-y-defunciones/nacimientos/nacimientos-2013) (2013); [DANE, Boletín técnico EEVV, cifras definitivas 2022 y III trimestre 2023pr](https://www.dane.gov.co/files/operaciones/EEVV/bol-EEVV-Nacimientos-IIItrim2023.pdf) (2013); [DANE, Estadísticas vitales: nacimientos 2014, cifras definitivas](https://www.dane.gov.co/index.php/estadisticas-por-tema/salud/nacimientos-y-defunciones/nacimientos/nacimientos-2014) (2014); [DANE, Boletín técnico EEVV, cifras definitivas 2023 y año corrido 2024pr (19 Dec 2024)](https://www.dane.gov.co/files/operaciones/EEVV/2024/19-dic-2024/bol-EEVV-Nacimientos-2024pr.pdf) (2014); [DANE, Estadísticas vitales: nacimientos 2015, cifras definitivas](https://www.dane.gov.co/index.php/estadisticas-por-tema/salud/nacimientos-y-defunciones/nacimientos/nacimientos-2015) (2015); [DANE, Boletín técnico EEVV, año 2024 y año corrido 2025pr (6 Feb 2026)](https://www.dane.gov.co/files/operaciones/EEVV/2026/6-feb-2026/bol-EEVV-Isem2025pr.pdf) (2015); [DANE, Estadísticas vitales: nacimientos 2016, cifras definitivas](https://www.dane.gov.co/index.php/estadisticas-por-tema/salud/nacimientos-y-defunciones/nacimientos/nacimientos-2016) (2016); [DANE, Boletín técnico EEVV, año 2025 y año corrido 2026pr (24 Sep 2026)](https://www.dane.gov.co/files/operaciones/EEVV/2026/24-sep-2026/bol-EEVV-Isem2026pr.pdf) (2016–2025); [DANE, Estadísticas vitales: nacimientos 2017, cifras definitivas](https://www.dane.gov.co/index.php/estadisticas-por-tema/salud/nacimientos-y-defunciones/nacimientos/nacimientos-2017) (2017); [DANE, Estadísticas vitales: nacimientos 2018, cifras definitivas](https://www.dane.gov.co/index.php/estadisticas-por-tema/salud/nacimientos-y-defunciones/nacimientos/nacimientos-2018) (2018); [DANE, Estadísticas vitales: nacimientos 2019, cifras definitivas](https://www.dane.gov.co/index.php/estadisticas-por-tema/salud/nacimientos-y-defunciones/nacimientos/nacimientos-2019) (2019); [DANE, Estadísticas vitales: nacimientos 2020, cifras definitivas](https://www.dane.gov.co/index.php/estadisticas-por-tema/salud/nacimientos-y-defunciones/nacimientos/nacimientos-2020) (2020); [DANE, Estadísticas vitales: nacimientos 2021, cifras definitivas](https://www.dane.gov.co/index.php/estadisticas-por-tema/salud/nacimientos-y-defunciones/nacimientos/nacimientos-2021) (2021); [DANE, Estadísticas vitales: nacimientos 2022, cifras definitivas](https://www.dane.gov.co/index.php/estadisticas-por-tema/salud/nacimientos-y-defunciones/nacimientos/nacimientos-2022) (2022); [DANE, Estadísticas vitales: nacimientos 2023, cifras definitivas](https://www.dane.gov.co/index.php/estadisticas-por-tema/salud/nacimientos-y-defunciones/nacimientos/nacimientos-2023) (2023); [DANE, Estadísticas vitales: nacimientos 2024, cifras definitivas](https://www.dane.gov.co/index.php/estadisticas-por-tema/salud/nacimientos-y-defunciones/nacimientos/nacimientos-2024) (2024); [DANE, Estadísticas vitales: nacimientos 2025, cifras definitivas](https://www.dane.gov.co/index.php/estadisticas-por-tema/salud/nacimientos-y-defunciones/nacimientos/nacimientos-2025) (2025). Notes: 2010–2018, 2022–2025: Births are birth certificates filled in at health facilities, not civil registrations. 2019–2021: Births are birth certificates filled in at health facilities, not civil registrations. Births include babies born in Colombia to mothers living abroad (1.4–1.8% of births).
