ov.ae/documents/37849/874734/UAE+Statistical+Annual+Report+2021.pdf/e13e370f-a025-7d53-ec8f-b211abfd3071) (2021); [Ministry of Health and Prevention (MOHAP), UAE, UAE Statistical Annual Report 2022](https://mohap.gov.ae/documents/37849/874734/UAE+Statistical+Annual+Report+2022.pdf/b08b0cd5-bd15-1940-ce0b-9ffd96dfe67d) (2022); [Ministry of Health and Prevention (MOHAP), UAE, UAE Statistical Annual Report 2023](https://mohap.gov.ae/documents/37849/874734/UAE+Statistical+Annual+Report+2023.pdf/484bbd9a-a2ce-f8e5-cb90-c1023269766a) (2023).
